          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ખાતું (khātũ) is a tadbhava. CDIAL lists it under Sanskrit kṣatrá, \"might, rule\", with the Gujarati senses \"administrative department, account, account book\" (CDIAL 3648)."
