          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જમા કરવું (jamā karvũ) is built from jamā, \"deposited, credited\", a loan from Arabic jamʿ, \"gathering, sum\", that reached Gujarati through Persian, and the light verb karvũ, \"to do\". Its Arabic root is j-m-ʿ, \"to gather\" (Lane)."
